版の範囲では第一週をクリアすることができません。<br />\n*現在のバージョン [Trial v1.2.1]<br />\n<br />\n■その他<br />\n本作品はRPGツクールMZで制作されております。<br />\nプレイにはマウス操作が必須となります。"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "登場人物", "body": [{"intro": "", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01330000/RJ01329528/150eda73b5ea630e6427ca01aa2162cf.jpg", "alt": "DEGRADE -隷属少女- [Lizard]", "title": "DEGRADE -隷属少女- [Lizard]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "ゲーム画像", "body": [{"intro": "", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01330000/RJ01329528/25c20122b9f6a33c2d2c5c50d5279d17.jpg", "alt": "DEGRADE -隷属少女- [Lizard]", "title": "DEGRADE -隷属少女- [Lizard]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "", "body": [{"intro": "", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01330000/RJ01329528/79df3b8a833477a34546f49b44556a41.jpg", "alt": "DEGRADE -隷属少女- [Lizard]", "title": "DEGRADE -隷属少女- [Lizard]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "", "body": [{"intro": "", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01330000/RJ01329528/7a8fae1e2c7c9ff9eec82973187bfa86.jpg", "alt": "DEGRADE -隷属少女- [Lizard]", "title": "DEGRADE -隷属少女- [Lizard]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "", "body": [{"intro": "", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01330000/RJ01329528/65c6394c8b51e91213f79c54dc68c5a0.jpg", "alt": "DEGRADE -隷属少女- [Lizard]", "title": "DEGRADE -隷属少女- [Lizard]"}, "position": "over"}]}], "description": "\"逆\"調教ローグライク風SLGです。男性受け、逆レ○プがメイン。", "short_introduction": "\"逆\"調教ローグライク風SLGです。男性受け、逆レ○プがメイン。", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01329528.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794949078}